# SERIAL alone, a win: the gun shoots the killers only and the game lasts
# the two minutes with 4 lives left (README.md, docs/serial/DESIGN.md).
#
#   zig-out/bin/noite --minigame serial --headless --ms 125000 --input tools/play/serial-alone-win.input
#   zig-out/bin/noite --minigame serial --headless --ms 125000 --fix all --input tools/play/serial-alone-win.input
#
# Generated by `tools/serial_plan.py --start 0 --win` (SERIAL's WM_CREATE at
# 0 ms seeds the figures; the hits change the spawns too). Every shot is a
# SPACE press with the bullet free; each hits the same figure in both
# versions: three killers, +600. The killers' other shots take one life,
# and the clock ends the game at 120000 ms. The result differs by BUGS.md
# K1/K2 only: the Original packs MAKELONG(lives 4, 500) = 32768004, the
# Corrigida reports +500.
1000 dump start
